title Team Notes

component notes-webapp as "Team Notes Web App" web-application
component notes-api as "Team Notes API" service
component notes-db as "Notes Database" database

east user-auth as "Thunder Auth" identity-server

north -> notes-webapp
north -> notes-api

notes-webapp -> notes-api
notes-webapp -> user-auth
notes-api -> user-auth
notes-api -> notes-db
